# Shell scripts must always be checked out with LF line endings. If a
# Windows user clones this repo with the common `core.autocrlf=true` setting,
# Git would otherwise convert LF -> CRLF on checkout, which breaks the
# `cat <<'EOF' ... EOF` heredocs in priprav_repo.sh (the EOF terminator with
# a trailing \r no longer matches).
*.sh text eol=lf
